Subject: [PATCH] feat(api): endpoints for Phantom Messenger pages (groups,
 contacts, saved, search, settings)

- Add contacts, saved collections/messages and user settings (migrations, models, services, controllers, resources)
- Add /groups, conversation preferences (mute/pin), group invites and conversation attachments
- Add unread_count, is_muted, is_pinned, description to the conversation resource
- Register /broadcasting/auth with Sanctum, add broadcasting config, broadcast MessageSent immediately
- Keep user presence (status/last_seen_at) in sync on login/logout
- CORS for the Angular origin; .env.example with Reverb key matching the frontend
- Demo seeder (login joker / password) and feature tests; README setup + endpoint table

